                            <P>
                              <L-1 L="EN">Several container instances can be defined for different EthIfControllers.</L-1>
                            </P>
                          </INTRODUCTION>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_EthIf_00116</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
