                        <L-2 L="EN">Container for the references to IdsMEvent elements representing the security events that the EthIf module shall report to the IdsM in case the coresponding security related event occurs (and if EthIfEnableSecurityEventReporting is set to "true"). The standardized security events in this container can be extended by vendor-specific security events.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Tags: atp.Status=draft</L-2>
                      </DESC>
